Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:54:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 52/65] A face liveness demo page in front of the debug page
 (task 21, A)

The debug and profile builds open a new page, LivenessDemoPage ("Face
liveness demo"), from the sign-in page; release builds get an empty
Scaffold, as for the debug page. English only, always left to right (the
app language it switches is for the face check, not for this menu).
Sections:
- Run a check: Resident face capture, Operator sign-in and Supervisor
  approval, each through LivenessGate.run with the real engine, as the
  debug page's hook gates call it. A result panel with a sentence
  ("Passed - no action needed", "Passed after N actions", "Not
  verified"), the engine's user message in English and one line of time
  and attempts. It never shows an image (a test checks it). Under it:
  "Always ask for actions" (the debug page's passiveThreshold 0.9999
  override), the app language (the debug page's list) and front/back
  (the camera override of all three workflows).
- Identity check (F15): enroll, check, delete, with the debug page's
  calls and the result in plain words.
- Models: the loaded version and the production model page, with the
  same diagnostics-only role override as the debug page.
- Diagnostics: tiles of the persisted metrics (8 existing fields, with
  units; no data shows "-"), Refresh, and Reset after a confirmation.
- Simulated screens: the fake engine's 13 scenarios in plain words; each
  opens LivenessPage on the fake engine with the placeholder preview.
- Developer tools: opens LivenessDebugPage. On return from it or from the
  model page, the shown state (overrides, models) is read again.

The native side keeps config overrides in memory and cannot list them, so
LivenessDevOverrides records the ones this process set. The debug page's
_setOverride now sets them through it: the same native call, the same log
line; nothing else in the debug page changes (its switches still start
off, as before).

Tests: liveness_demo_page_test.dart, 11 (no overflow at 360x640 and
412x915 at text scale 1.0 and 1.3, including a failed result; each check
card runs the gate with its workflow; no image in the result panel; each
simulated row selects its scenario on the fake engine; the overrides;
F15; the metrics tiles and Reset; Developer tools opens the debug page and
the return refreshes). FakeLivenessService records the overrides and has a
settable model version. flutter test test/liveness: 298 passing, 20
skipped (the screenshots).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
